      "headline": "Salesforce Developer at Wipro | Sales Cloud | 4x Salesforce Certified | Trailhead Ranger",
      "about": "As a Salesforce Developer with 3+ years of experience, I am passionate about creating innovative solutions that drive business success. My journey is supported by certifications in Salesforce Data Cloud Consultant, Platform Developer I (PD1), Salesforce Administrator, and Al Associate, equipping me with a strong blend of development, administration, and data management expertise.\n\nCore Competencies:\n         Lightning Web Components (LWC): Building dynamic and responsive user interfaces.\n         Apex Development: Writing efficient code for custom business logic.\n         Salesforce Flows & Automation: Streamlining complex business processes through automation.\n         Sales Cloud & Service Cloud: Customizing solutions to boost sales performance and enhance customer service operations.\n          Data Migration & Integration: Ensuring data integrity during migrations and integrating Salesforce with external systems (REST/SOAP APIs).\n          SOQL & SOSL: Writing complex queries to interact with Salesforce data.\n          Analytics (Einstein Analytics): Leveraging analytics for actionable business insights.\n          Agile Methodologies & CI/CD: Applying Agile frameworks and CI/CD practices for efficient development cycles.\n         Git & Version Control: Managing version control and collaborating effectively within teams.\n         Salesforce Data Cloud: Implementing data solutions, data integration, and analytics to optimize data architecture and unlock insights.\n\nIn my current role, I have developed and maintained custom Salesforce applications, automated business processes, and implemented comprehensive Salesforce Cloud solutions. I am driven by a commitment to excellence and leveraging technology to solve real-world business challenges.\n\nI am always eager to connect with professionals, share insights, and explore opportunities to contribute to innovative projects. Let's connect and explore how I can add value to your team!",
